---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: supplyTokens()
    q_check_auth --> q_check_tge: caller == projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_tge --> q_check_supplied: tgeDetailsPublished == true
    q_check_tge --> q_revert_tge: TGE details not published
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_fees: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: already supplied
    q_calc_fees --> q_calc_total: tokenFee = totalTokensAllocated * legionFeeOnTokensSoldBps / 10000
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = totalTokensAllocated + tokenFee
    q_transfer --> q_set_supplied: askToken.transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_set_supplied --> q_emit: tokensSupplied = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokensSupplied(totalRequired)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_tge --> [*]: revert TGENotPublished
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert AlreadySupplied

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: requires TGE details (askToken address) before supply
        INV-002: fee calculated on totalTokensAllocated not totalRequired
        INV-003: project supplies tokens + Legion fee in single transferFrom
    end note
